---
// SectionWorkflow.astro - 02 / THE WORKFLOW
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<section id="how-it-works" class="py-20 border-b border-tide-border bg-tide-surface/30 relative scroll-mt-14">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section label -->
    <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-tide-accent font-mono mb-4">
      02 / THE WORKFLOW
    </div>

    <!-- Header Row -->
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-tide-text leading-tight font-mono">
        Deterministic agent lifecycle.<br />
        From worktree isolation to fast-forward merge.
      </h2>
      <a
        href={`${base}/docs#pipeline`}
        class="text-xs font-mono text-tide-accent hover:underline flex items-center gap-1 shrink-0"
      >
        <span>Read systems pipeline documentation</span>
        <span>↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- 5-Step Connected Flow -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4 relative mb-12">
      
      <!-- Step 01 -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-lg border border-tide-border bg-tide-surface flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4 relative group hover:border-tide-border-active transition-all">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
            <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full border border-tide-border bg-tide-variant text-tide-accent font-mono text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center">
              01
            </span>
            <span class="text-tide-muted text-[10px] font-mono">&rarr;</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-tide-text font-mono mb-1">
            Single-Command Boot
          </h3>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-tide-muted font-mono mb-2">
            Host &middot; Fast Native PTY
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-tide-text-secondary leading-relaxed font-sans">
            Launch instantly with <code class="text-tide-accent font-mono">tide .</code> in under 500ms. Reads <code class="text-tide-accent font-mono text-[11px]">tide.toml</code> and spins up the multiplexed terminal loop.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 02 -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-lg border border-tide-border bg-tide-surface flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4 relative group hover:border-tide-border-active transition-all">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
            <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full border border-tide-border bg-tide-variant text-tide-accent font-mono text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center">
              02
            </span>
            <span class="text-tide-muted text-[10px] font-mono">&rarr;</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-tide-text font-mono mb-1">
            Worktree Isolation
          </h3>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-tide-muted font-mono mb-2">
            Dedicated Git Worktree
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-tide-text-secondary leading-relaxed font-sans">
            Each agent tab allocates an ephemeral Git worktree under <code class="text-tide-accent font-mono text-[11px]">.tide/worktrees/</code>. Agents mutate code without polluting your main index.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 03 -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-lg border border-tide-border bg-tide-surface flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4 relative group hover:border-tide-border-active transition-all">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
            <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full border border-tide-border bg-tide-variant text-tide-accent font-mono text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center">
              03
            </span>
            <span class="text-tide-muted text-[10px] font-mono">&rarr;</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-tide-text font-mono mb-1">
            Kernel Containment
          </h3>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-tide-muted font-mono mb-2">
            Job Objects &middot; No Orphans
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-tide-text-secondary leading-relaxed font-sans">
            Subprocesses and tool calls are bound to OS Job Objects. When a tab terminates, all child trees, background servers, and sockets are cleanly torn down.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 04 -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-lg border border-tide-border bg-tide-surface flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4 relative group hover:border-tide-border-active transition-all">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
            <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full border border-tide-border bg-tide-variant text-tide-accent font-mono text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center">
              04
            </span>
            <span class="text-tide-muted text-[10px] font-mono">&rarr;</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-tide-text font-mono mb-1">
            In-TUI Diff Inspection
          </h3>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-tide-muted font-mono mb-2">
            Unified & Split &middot; Diagnostics
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-tide-text-secondary leading-relaxed font-sans">
            Review agent-generated changes with side-by-side diffs. Jump to compiler diagnostic errors directly from output with <kbd class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-tide-variant text-[10px] border border-tide-border text-tide-text font-mono">Ctrl+G</kbd>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 05 -->
      <div class="p-5 rounded-lg border border-tide-border bg-tide-surface flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4 relative group hover:border-tide-border-active transition-all">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
            <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full border border-tide-border bg-tide-variant text-tide-accent font-mono text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center">
              05
            </span>
            <span class="text-tide-success text-[10px] font-mono">✓</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-tide-text font-mono mb-1">
            Verification & Merge
          </h3>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-tide-muted font-mono mb-2">
            Pre-flight test &middot; Fast-forward
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-tide-text-secondary leading-relaxed font-sans">
            Press <kbd class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-tide-variant text-[10px] border border-tide-border text-tide-text font-mono">v</kbd> to run test suites in the worktree, then merge verified changes into main and clean up the worktree cleanly.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Stepped Prompt Callout -->
    <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-lg border border-tide-border bg-tide-surface flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-xs">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-tide-accent font-bold select-none">&gt;</span>
        <span class="text-tide-text font-bold">Non-destructive concurrency: <code class="text-tide-accent">“tide .”</code></span>
      </div>
      <div class="text-tide-text-secondary text-[11px] font-sans">
        Worktrees remain decoupled until explicitly verified and merged. <a href={`${base}/docs#quickstart`} class="text-tide-accent hover:underline font-mono">Read quickstart &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
